pageType: cover
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  先讲结论：项目的代码和离线验证已经形成工程骨架，车辆基础栈和小尺度路线已经有实机结果；接下来重点不是继续堆离线功能，而是补 RTK、安全、正式场地和真实采样证据。
elements:
  - elementId: cover-mark
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [58, 56, 9, 112]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: cover-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 54, 790, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      fontSize: 34
      wrap: false
      text: PCR 项目组内进度同步
  - elementId: cover-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 112, 760, 30]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      color: "$muted"
      wrap: false
      text: 车辆 ROS / Web 控制台 / PCR 算法 / 集成验证
  - elementId: cover-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [88, 177, 790, 2]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: cover-conclusion
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 208, 790, 76]
    content:
      style: "$section"
      fontSize: 23
      lineHeight: 1.35
      text: |
        已形成“规划 → 车辆执行 → 数据回传 → 风险预测”的工程骨架。
        当前进入现场证据收口阶段：RTK、failsafe、正式场地、真实采样仍未闭环。
  - elementId: metric-line-1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [90, 355, 235, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$line"
  - elementId: metric-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 372, 235, 42]
    content:
      style: "$metric"
      text: 91 + 5 + 7
  - elementId: metric-label-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 420, 235, 28]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      color: "$muted"
      text: 车辆离线测试 / GNSS / YAML
  - elementId: metric-line-2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [360, 355, 235, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$line"
  - elementId: metric-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [360, 372, 235, 42]
    content:
      style: "$metric"
      text: 6 类 / 9 次
  - elementId: metric-label-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [360, 420, 235, 28]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      color: "$muted"
      text: 小尺度实车路线测试
  - elementId: metric-line-3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [630, 355, 235, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$line"
  - elementId: metric-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [630, 372, 235, 42]
    content:
      style: "$metric"
      text: 5 项
  - elementId: metric-label-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [630, 420, 235, 28]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      color: "$muted"
      text: RTK / 真值 / 采样 / 安全缺口
  - elementId: cover-date
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 492, 540, 18]
    content:
      style: "$muted"
      text: 截止 2026-09-05｜组内进度同步
  - elementId: cover-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [850, 492, 50, 18]
    content:
      style: "$muted"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 01 / 11

